              "instruction": "nadīlā pūr ālyās hā pūl band hoīl. — Should the river flood, this bridge will be closed.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nadīlā pūr ālyās hā pūl band hoīl.* — Should the river flood, this bridge will be closed.]"
