              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रस्त्यावर गुडघाभर पाणी साचलं. rastyāvar guḍghābhar pāṇī sāclaṁ. Knee-deep water collected on the road."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो साचला, to sāclā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of water, dust or work: काम साचलं, the work piled up."
            }
          ]
        },
